  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=231C25&amp;color=5c2a21\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fobscure-tooltips-media-kit-VPpfjxP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Media Kit\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Get Media Kit-5c4521?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=imgur&amp;labelColor=251C20&amp;logoColor=white\"></a>\n</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Obscure Tooltips 是一款客戶端視覺強化模組，能將普通的物品提示轉化為富有表現力的動態展示。它透過引入流暢的動畫、動態粒子效果以及根據物品稀有度和情境自適應的裝飾性邊框，為您的物品欄增添沉浸式的視覺風格。</h2><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Rn2RuE.png\"></p><p><br></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BUUrpIP.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">動態提示</h1>\n        <p>流暢的動畫、發光邊框和細膩的粒子效果讓每個提示框都栩栩如生。樣式支援多種視覺效果——從動態裝飾到層疊特效——讓每件物品都顯得獨特且富有表現力。</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">整合式模型</h1>\n        <p>直接在提示框內以完整整合的 3D 形式查看任何護甲、工具或武器。無需裝備或開啟額外選單，即可即時預覽裝備。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nhHUKgM.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E9yChOe.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">流暢捲動</h1>\n        <p>當提示框超過螢幕高度時，自動啟動流暢捲動功能，保持文字清晰可讀而不雜亂。讓您能自然地閱讀長篇描述，無需調整使用者介面大小。</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">自動換行</h1>\n        <p>智慧換行功能讓寬幅提示框保持整潔、易讀且格式完美。長名稱、傳說文字和屬性數據將保持對齊，不會超出佈局範圍。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gUXvCIP.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4yIqabL.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">無與倫比的自訂性</h1>\n        <p>Obscure Tooltips 是首個引入完整動態、視覺豐富提示框的模組，雖然後來出現了類似模組，但其模組化、數據驅動的設計仍提供獨特的靈活性，讓您能<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523tooltip-styles\" rel=\"nofollow\">建立</a>與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523style-merging-fallback\" rel=\"nofollow\">合併樣式</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523tooltip-filters\" rel=\"nofollow\">設定條件</a>，並<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523core-concept\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂每個元素</a>以符合您的視覺構想。</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br>\n<br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></p><p><br></p><h2>遊戲內設定</h2><p>在 Minecraft 1.20.1 版本中，若使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config Screens</a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a>模組，即可使用遊戲內設定選單。若未安裝這些模組，所有設定仍可透過設定檔案（<em>config/obscuria/obscure_tooltips-client.toml</em>）調整。從 Minecraft 1.21.1 版本開始，遊戲內設定畫面將預設提供，無需額外依賴模組。</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZBaOT4.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AWVa1rL.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0F3Uyq.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillager-caravans\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lPK6BrB.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elixirum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zMZKr3b.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjJSLI0.png\" width=\"45%\">\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lV9g9R.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Y7y8mO.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>",
